{
  "project": {
    "name": "Sari Blouse (Choli)",
    "slug": "sari-blouse",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "The choli — the fitted, cropped blouse worn with the sari and lehenga across South Asia: close-fitting to the bust with a short hem above the midriff, short set-in sleeves, a back opening, and its signature bust darts. This cartridge drafts the fitted garment geometry to measure — a shaped front and back with marked bust/shaping darts and a short sleeve. The silk, the border, the mirror (shisha) work, and the embroidery are the maker's. Offered with respect for the living tradition.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "El choli — la blusa entallada y corta que se usa con el sari y el lehenga en el sur de Asia: ceñida al busto con un ruedo corto sobre la cintura, mangas cortas montadas, una abertura trasera y sus pinzas de busto características. Este cartucho traza la geometría entallada a la medida — un delantero y espalda con forma y pinzas marcadas y una manga corta. La seda, el borde, el trabajo de espejo (shisha) y el bordado los aporta quien lo elabora. Ofrecido con respeto por la tradición viva.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "choli",
      "sari-blouse",
      "heritage",
      "south-asia",
      "blouse",
      "bust-dart",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "LicenseRef-FC1-pending",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
